            "review_title": "Review at mAd craft- local signature",
            "review_text": "Roam34912533220\n2 contributions\n0\nGood vibe explorer\nJun 2026 • Friends\nFound this random local spot and honestly, best decision ever. No fancy stuff, just a super chill vibe that makes you wanna sit forever. The owner is such a dude — big smile, cracking jokes, treating everyone like an old friend. He straight up told me he runs the place just because he's crazy about flavors, no other reason. And you can tell, because the drinks slap. Service was solid too. Then the bill came... I legit asked if he forgot something. Ridiculously cheap, like makes-no-sense cheap.\nSo yeah, came for a drink, left with a new friend, a favorite local hangout in Vietnam, and a core memory. If you're around, must try.\nRead more\nWritten June 6, 2026",
